on, Son &amp; Co. v. Bird\">248 U. S. 268, 271</a></span>. (2) <em>Farrell </em>v. <em>O\u2019Brien, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"96328\"><a href=\"/opinion/96328/farrell-v-obrien/#100\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Farrell v. O&#x27;Brien\">199 U. S. 89, 100</a></span>; <em>Goodrich </em>v. <em>Ferris, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"97034\"><a href=\"/opinion/97034/goodrich-v-ferris/#79\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Goodrich v. Ferris\">214 U. S. 71, 79</a></span>; <em>Chicago, Rock Island &amp; Pacific Ry. Co. </em>v. <em>Maucher, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"99263\"><a href=\"/opinion/99263/chicago-rock-island-pacific-railway-co-v-maucher/#362\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Chicago, Rock Island &amp; Pacific Railway Co. v. Maucher\">248 U. S. 359, 362</a></span>; <em>Berkman </em>v. <em>United States, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"99402\"><a href=\"/opinion/99402/berkman-v-united-states/#118\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Berkman v. United States\">250 U. S. 114, 118</a></span>. <em>Mr. Earl H. Turner </em>for plaintiff in error. <em>Mr. J. H. Goeke, Mr. T. T. Ansberry </em>and <em>Mr. George T. Farrell </em>for defendants in error.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}